 "result": "I worked two apps, fixed one, and couldn't find a repo for the other.\n\nFor topo-wars-server, the root URL returns 404 because the backend has no home page. I added a health route that returns 200 with a small JSON body and pings Redis if Redis is configured. I ran the handler locally, but only the \"not configured\" path, so the Redis ping is untested. I also added a vercel.json rewrite so /health works as well as /api/health. The pull request is github.com/sudosilo/topo-wars-server/pull/1. After it is merged, topo-wars-server.vercel.app/health can be added to apps.json.\n\nFor snapshot-engine-pied, no sudosilo repo matches the name and scribe/repos.json has no entry for it. I logged it as repo not found and changed nothing.\n\nBoth jobs are logged in fix-log.json, which I pushed to main.",
